{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"05596045b4e40fc907d892cb0d7557959610a9d5e2507bef96712a3d6245cbcf","ja":"お茶会で大切なこと","zh":"茶会中重要的事情","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8d8b5d39d908dec8362fa5655ede6e23f059f9552d4173d311233a44d58e0e7f","ja":"エミリーちゃんがソワソワしてたのって……\n和菓子を買ってたから、だったの？","zh":"艾米莉坐立不安……\n是因为买了日式点心吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"00fb87e641aa693e384190fd434e5c8c33d2065f0447d194fbc919ee3a412e25","ja":"はい……すみません！\nこの場に合わないことは分かっていたのですが……。","zh":"好的……非常抱歉！\n我也明白这很不合时宜，只是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2b39825fe20bea9f251b6e71617c4704932c217c85642564d794db90ea100570","ja":"桜を模したこちらの和菓子が\nとても可愛らしくて、つい……。","zh":"这款仿照樱花制作的和果子\n实在是太可爱了，我不由得就……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"61bf149502c7b0c9f0261d63b2350b62bc10486d320ee697f0401a59f54df970","ja":"そうだったんだ。せっかくだし、これも食べようよ♪\nそれに確か……ちょっと待っててね、調べるから。","zh":"原来是这样啊。机会难得，也尝尝这个吧♪\n而且我记得……稍等一下哦，我查查。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b941fc029e6500138c72e9fa787ef36007bd86466f76e98e9fb37c8e1191f983","ja":"やっぱり！　ほら、見て。\n和のアフタヌーンティーっていうのもあるみたいだよ。","zh":"果然！你看，还有日式下午茶呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c7c0387a67f413027cbc5913958ac15f3d0bef7d77bab5a6789c80f6c9f8c550","ja":"緑茶や和菓子を並べて……？　Wow♪\nとっても華やかですね♪　和洋折衷のもあって。","zh":"摆上绿茶和日式点心……？哇哦♪\n好华丽呀♪里面还有和洋结合的呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"19de4b606cae5d64246b42d57557d07debe689aeeaa61833c1c47698337c13b1","ja":"うん。自由なお茶会って感じで、面白いよね。\nマナーも大事だけど……楽しむのが一番重要なのかも。","zh":"嗯。有种自由茶会的感觉，挺有意思的呢。\n礼仪虽然也很重要……但最关键的或许还是享受其中吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9f9c657ff85c8930c5e269614b6f1198efac1ca70f8753bc7bad1d133616dba8","ja":"ドラマの役も、格式高い場ってわけでもないから……\n肩ひじ張らずに、リラックスした方がいいのかな。","zh":"电视剧里的角色也算不上什么特别讲究规矩的场合……\n不用那么拘束，放松一些会比较好吗。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c2f1fef1c3aeffc2958fbc5954c15f1e73f10956b9e3e977a04116f9bb7361f8","ja":"私もつい「こうでなくては」と考えていた気がします。\nですがお茶会の世界は、もっと自由なのですね♪","zh":"我也感觉自己不知不觉中总想着“必须得是这样才行”。\n但茶会的世界，其实更加自由呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"82d85f265e2e8dfda4c99f15069aa4a640ee0b8e1ab233c4ac45fb0786e73d0b","ja":"それでは……琴葉さん。\n桜の和菓子も、一緒に味わっていただけますか？","zh":"那么……琴叶。\n樱花和果子，也请您一同品尝好吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1728.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"9308750712d6a394d155a341d970f4a195ae2dacc2231b7ccd8fee1ed75d68bc","ja":"うん、もちろん♪\nどんな味がするのかな？　いただきまーす♪","zh":"嗯，当然啦♪\n会是什么味道呢？我开动啦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
